@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title USE CASE - PHÂN HỆ MATCHING & ANALYTICS

actor Candidate
actor HR
actor Admin

rectangle "Matching & Analytics" {
  usecase "UC15 Tính mức độ tương thích\natomic batch + stale-worker guard" as UC15
  usecase "Skill Matching" as M1
  usecase "Semantic Matching\nmodel + preprocessing version" as M2
  usecase "Experience Matching\nquantifiable intervals" as M3
  usecase "Tổng hợp Overall Score" as M4
  usecase "UC16 Xem kết quả hiện hành\n& Skill Gap" as UC16
  usecase "UC17 Xem leaderboard\n(kho CV của HR)" as UC17
  usecase "UC18 Cấu hình trọng số\nrevision++ + invalidate" as UC18
  usecase "UC19 Xuất báo cáo [Advanced]" as UC19
  usecase "LLM/XAI giải thích [Advanced]" as M5
}

Candidate --> UC15
Candidate --> UC16
HR --> UC15
HR --> UC16
HR --> UC17
HR --> UC18
HR --> UC19
Admin --> UC15
Admin --> UC16
Admin --> UC17
Admin --> UC18
Admin --> UC19

UC15 ..> M1 : <<include>>
UC15 ..> M2 : <<include>>
UC15 ..> M3 : <<include>>
UC15 ..> M4 : <<include>>
M5 ..> UC16 : <<extend>>
UC19 ..> UC17 : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC15
Validate full batch trước mutation.
Task dùng generation + Resume/JD revision guard.
end note

note bottom of UC16
Candidate: chỉ Match của CV mình.
HR: chỉ Match khi JD + CV đều thuộc HR.
end note
@enduml
